(text "DI-8 CARD, card type 0x0010. Fits any universal LV slot (LV coding notch).\nSelf-contained: own bias supply (copy of baseline bank-B switch/eFuse, fed\nfrom VBAT_FIELD), own 74HC14 Schmitt triggers, own MCP23S17 on the slot SPI\nbus.\nMCP23S17: GPA0-7 = IN1_N..IN8_N; GPB0 BIAS_ON, GPB1 BIAS_DISCH, GPB2\nCARD_FAULT_N (eFuse fault, also to the slot), GPB4-7 slot ID straps (internal\npull-ups).\nBaseline names: IN1..IN8 = DI5..DI12, BIAS = DI_BIAS_B. Net changes:\nnet_changes.csv." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 158.75 214.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6328ec9f-c452-42f9-81dc-37f33f196590"))
